= 0 \\\\ R(c) &= c^{2} \\ln{\\left(c \\right)} \\\\  &= - \\frac{1}{e^{2}}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe values differ, so this is *not* an equilibrium solution.\n\n- For $y=c=1$, evaluate the non-derivative left and right sides, denoted $L(c)$ and $R(c)$:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\ln{\\left(c \\right)} &= \\ln{\\left(1 \\right)} \\\\  &= 0 \\\\ L(c) &= 0 \\\\  &= 0 \\\\ R(c) &= c^{2} \\ln{\\left(c \\right)} \\\\  &= 0\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe values agree, so this is an equilibrium solution.\n\nSelect $y=1$."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186694197 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "7209307b-a1df-5994-bb8f-93c5616382d3" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186694182} {:answer/id #uuid "be42b235-bb61-5875-9cbe-b75ea30eceb2" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186694202}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "7209307b-a1df-5994-bb8f-93c5616382d3" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186694182} :answer-field/id #uuid "5fc1a6b2-16f8-5b32-af02-300195b9f18b" :answer-field/key "$y=0$" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186694180} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "117b4a8a-e099-5ac6-af17-f82cd1906a18" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186694168} {:answer/id #uuid "e852e147-eb67-50d2-889c-e81fc264aaa7" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186694209}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "e852e147-eb67-50d2-889c-e81fc264aaa7" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186694209} :answer-field/id #uuid "b1e2091c-2de0-5adb-8fbc-af789992df9d" :answer-field/key "$y=-3$" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186694195} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "87c5576f-473c-5