evaluate the non-derivative left and right sides, denoted $L(c)$ and $R(c)$:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}L(c) &= 0 \\\\  &= 0 \\\\ R(c) &= \\frac{- c^{2} - 4 c - 3}{\\left(c + 2\\right)^{2}} \\\\  &= - \\frac{8}{9}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe values differ, so this is *not* an equilibrium solution.\n\nSelect $y=-3$."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186694208 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "277877ac-e9d2-515c-b6f6-22a95bdd8660" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186694171} {:answer/id #uuid "95bb4553-68bd-50b3-958a-5eb8b5717cc5" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186694188}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "95bb4553-68bd-50b3-958a-5eb8b5717cc5" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186694188} :answer-field/id #uuid "543b9ecd-d318-5d68-9c82-9b3e7b102fe3" :answer-field/key "$y=-3$" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186694176} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "9cc5b3cc-ba28-55fd-9c8f-a02ddb915698" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186694190} {:answer/id #uuid "a41133cc-841e-5bcb-9266-74d12aac3a8b" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186694191}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "a41133cc-841e-5bcb-9266-74d12aac3a8b" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186694191} :answer-field/id #uuid "80ef7cb7-b30d-578e-b4ab-55c17fdd0112" :answer-field/key "$y=2$" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186694183} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "a5a63657-5edc-5ed9-82ee-14a0fcb041ad" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186694192} {:answer/id #uuid "b3b81cc8-62d5-5abd-b231-7c6fb2c007a1" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186694196}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "a5a63657-5edc-5ed9-82ee-14a0fcb041ad" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186694192} :answer-field/id #uuid "b762d04f-959d-561b-80a0-278df0d5be62" :answer-field/key "$y=-2$" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186694198}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "e7715b81-843e-5db1-9632-e9cb28b60f39" :question/problem "Consider the differential equation\n\n$$\n\\frac{dy}{dt} = - 2 y^{2} - 2 y + 4.\n$$\n\nA constant function $y(t)=c$ is an **equilibrium solution** when it is in the domain of the equation and makes the derivative zero.\n\nWhich of the following are equilibrium solutions? Select all that apply." :question/worked-solution "A constant function $y(t)=c$ has derivative $dy/dt=0$. It must satisfy the original equation and its domain restrictions.\n\nTest each supplied constant in the original equation, with the derivative set to zero.\n\n- For $y=c=2$, evaluate the non-derivative left and right sides, denoted $L(c)$ and $R(c)$:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}L(c) &= 0 \\\\  &= 0 \\\\ R(c) &= - 2 c^{2} - 2 c + 4 \\\\  &= -8\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe values differ, so this is *not* an equilibrium solution.\n\n- For $y=c=-3$, evaluate the non-derivative left and right sides, denoted $L(c)$ and $R(c)$:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}L(c) &= 0 \\\\  &= 0 \\\\ R(c) &= - 2 c^{2} - 2 c + 4 \\\\  &= -8\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe values differ, so this is *not* an equilibrium solution.\n\n- For $y=c=-2$, evaluate the non-derivative left and right sides, denoted $L(c)$ and $R(c)$:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}L(c) &= 0 \\\\  &= 0 \\\\ R(c) &= - 2 c^{2} - 2 c + 4 \\\\  &= 0\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe values agree, so this is an equilibrium solution.\n\nSelect $y=-2$."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186694216 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "290598d9-2b1b-57e3-aef3-a3845383d108" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186694223} {:answer/id #uuid "5472eff4-bd9b-5015-8f7f-515d0a522bc3" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186694231}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "5472eff4-bd9b-5015-8f7f-515d0a522bc3" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186694231} :answer-field/id #uuid "26eac2c1-2e60-553a-857c-55abaa458f62" :answer-field/key "$y=2$" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186694221} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "0af6fb28-003a-5d07-ad73-463f7d764c4b" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186694218} {:answer/id #uuid "c441c708-894f-55e5-a403-220fa7550f22" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186694246}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "0af6fb28-003a-5d07-ad73-463f7d764c4b" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186694218} :answer-field/id #uuid "5c277f71-91a9-5007-af5c-e6bb6ac1c836" :answer-field/key "$y=-1$" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186694233} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "4ff7e95a-de74-5a0c-8dcf-afb67101c039" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186694230} {:answer/id #uuid "7ae23354-8cee-5ab6-95fc-a11677b52b13" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186694239}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "7ae23354-8cee-5ab6-95fc-a11677b52b13" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186694239} :answer-field/id #uuid "fc3fdee4-a27b-5db4-ae72-cec42e922f2f" :answer-field/key "$y=3$" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186694253}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/hard} :question/id #uuid "06d85296-9540-5a88-8f65-26dcc45c28d4" :question/problem "Consider the differential equation\n\n$$\n\\frac{dy}{dt} = \\frac{y^{2} - y - 2}{y - 3}.\n$$\n\nWhich of the following are equilibrium solutions? Select all that apply." :question/worked-solution "A constant function $y(t)=c$ has derivative $dy/dt=0$. It must satisfy the original equation and its domain restrictions.\n\nThe original equation requires $y - 3\\ne0$.\n\nTest each supplied constant in the original equation, with the derivative set to zero.\n\n- For $y=c=-1$, evaluate the non-derivative left and right sides, denoted $L(c)$ and $R(c)$:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}L(c) &= 0 \\\\  &= 0 \\\\ R(c) &= \\frac{c^{2} - c - 2}{c - 3} \\\\  &= 0\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe values agree, so this is an equilibrium solution.\n\n- For $y=c=2$, evaluate the non-derivative left and right sides, denoted $L(c)$ and $R(c)$:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}L(c) &= 0 \\\\  &= 0 \\\\ R(c) &= \\frac{c^{2} - c - 2}{c - 3} \\\\  &= 0\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe values agree, so this is an equilibrium solution.\n\n- For $y=c=3$, $y - 3=\\left(3\\right) - 3=0$ violates the original domain. This is *not* an equilibrium solution; cancellation cannot restore an excluded value.\n\nSelect $y=-1$ and $y=2$."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186694225 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "8921f262-7f92-5fff-9d77-b7b19c272da1" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186694241} {:answer/id #uuid "d669c11a-661b-5d6a-9b0e-42ddf17eaa0c" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186694248}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "d669c11a-661b-5d6a-9b0e-42ddf17eaa0c" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186694248} :answer-field/id #uuid "3651d667-6c75-50f6-acba-e345056e7159" :answer-field/key 